# `const list = []` of which no storage is declared begins with the narrowest storage, as an empty list of the engine does, and what is appended to it decides: int32s, doubles, any value.
# A site that makes one list learns nothing, and its list was made with storage for any value: that says nothing of the elements to whoever tests the kind in front of a loop.
# -- source: main.js
